     "Hey I'm Emiliano a PhD student at Mila-Quebec/Université de Montréal, currently under the supervision of Laurent Charlin",

      "My current work focuses on enhancing the capabilities and alignment of LLM agents in complex multi-step environments. Unlike other ML systems, LMs can converse—an exciting capability that comes with many benefits as well as risks. My research explores how to leverage this property to improve both capabilities and alignment, specifically at the user level."





